@host = http://localhost:5100

### Command: add a book (returns only the id)
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dune", "year": 1965, "authorId": 2, "genreIds": [3] }

### Query: books in a genre
GET {{host}}/api/books?genre=Fantasy

### Ada borrows Nineteen Eighty-Four (201)
POST {{host}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "bookId": 1 }

### Alan tries the same book (409: already on loan)
POST {{host}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 2, "bookId": 1 }

### Ada borrows Animal Farm (201), then The Hobbit (409: limit 2)
POST {{host}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "bookId": 2 }

###
POST {{host}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberId": 1, "bookId": 3 }

### Return loan 1 (200), then again (409)
POST {{host}}/api/loans/1/return

###
POST {{host}}/api/loans/1/return

### Query: Ada's open loans
GET {{host}}/api/members/1/loans?openOnly=true

### A member that does not exist (404)
GET {{host}}/api/members/9/loans